    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "iMOVE are delighted to present this exceptional three-bedroom mid-terrace residence to the Malahide market. Ideally positioned within the popular Waterside development, the property enjoys a particularly attractive outlook over a large open green and sports playing field.\r\n\r\nThe house has been well maintained throughout and offers bright, practical accommodation ideally suited to family living. Notable features include a spacious kitchen with quartz worktops and dining area, principal bedroom with ensuite, fitted wardrobes in all three bedrooms, an alarm system and a substantial walled rear garden extending to approximately 14.75 metres in length with raised decking area and shed.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises an entrance hall, guest WC, living room and open-plan kitchen and dining area with direct access to the rear garden. Upstairs, there are three well-proportioned bedrooms, including a principal bedroom with ensuite, together with the main family bathroom.\r\n\r\nWaterside is a highly convenient and well-established residential development located within easy reach of both Malahide and Swords. A frequent bus service operates from the entrance to the development, while Malahide DART and railway station is approximately five minutes away by car. Dublin Airport, the M1 and M50 motorways, Swords Pavilions, Airside Retail Park and the excellent shops, schools, restaurants and recreational amenities of Malahide are also readily accessible.\r\n\r\nThe combination of a large rear garden, open green outlook and convenient location makes this an excellent opportunity for families and first-time buyers alike.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Accommodation\r\nEntrance Hall\r\n\r\n5.14m x 1.89m\r\n\r\nPart-tiled flooring at the entrance with laminate flooring continuing through the hallway.\r\n\r\nGuest WC\r\n\r\n1.94m x 1.39m\r\n\r\nWC, wash-hand basin, tiled floor and mirror.\r\n\r\nLiving Room\r\n\r\n4.90m x 3.13m\r\n\r\nBright and comfortable reception room with laminate flooring, television point and double doors leading to the kitchen and dining area.\r\n\r\nKitchen / Dining Area\r\n\r\n5.14m x 3.56m\r\n\r\nSpacious kitchen and dining area fitted with a range of wall and floor-mounted kitchen units. Fridge-freezer and dishwasher. Tiled flooring in the kitchen area and laminate flooring in the dining area. Patio doors provide direct access to the rear garden. Quartz worktops.\r\n\r\nRear Garden\r\n\r\nApproximately 14.75m x 5.35m\r\n\r\nA particularly large, walled rear garden laid mainly in lawn, offering excellent space for children, outdoor dining and entertaining on a large raised decking area.\r\n\r\nFirst Floor\r\nLanding\r\n\r\nCarpet flooring with hot press and fitted shelving.\r\n\r\nPrincipal Bedroom\r\n\r\n3.99m x 3.05m\r\n\r\nDouble bedroom with carpet flooring, built-in wardrobes and ensuite bathroom.\r\n\r\nEnsuite\r\n\r\nWC, wash-hand basin, shower and extractor fan.\r\n\r\nBedroom Two\r\n\r\n3.36m x 3.05m\r\n\r\nDouble bedroom with carpet flooring and built-in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBedroom Three\r\n\r\n3.50m x 2.90m\r\n\r\nGenerous bedroom with carpet flooring and built-in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nMain Bathroom\r\n\r\n2.57m x 1.93m\r\n\r\nWC, wash-hand basin and bath with wall-mounted shower attachment. Tiled floor, tiled bath surround, mirror and wall light."
      },
